    "html": "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#07070a;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 12px;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Your order is delayed. Here is what is happening.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#111116;border:1px solid #26262f;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<tr><td style=\"height:3px;background:#1fff6b;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:30px 32px 6px;\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dm4jfxbcs/image/upload/v1794414758/ufoloabz-logo_etekla.png\" alt=\"UFO LABZ\" width=\"150\" style=\"display:block;border:0;height:auto;max-width:150px;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:22px 36px 8px;\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font:800 26px/1.25 'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.3px;\">Your order is running late</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font:400 15px/1.65 'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ececf2;\">Hi {{first_name}}, we are sorry. Your order <b>{{order_number}}</b> is taking longer than planned.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#0c0c11;border:1px solid #26262f;border-left:3px solid #ffb020;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;font:400 14px/1.6 'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ececf2;\"><b>Reason:</b> {{delay_reason}}<br><b>New estimated dispatch:</b> {{new_eta}}</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font:400 15px/1.65 'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ececf2;\">You do not need to do anything. We will email you the tracking number as soon as it ships. If you prefer to cancel for a full refund, reply to this email or use the button below.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#1fff6b;border-radius:8px;\"><a href=\"{{order_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font:700 15px 'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#03140a;text-decoration:none;\">View order status</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font:400 13px/1.6 'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#9b9bab;\">Thank you for your patience. We know you are waiting for your stack.</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 36px 30px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #26262f;\"><tr><td style=\"padding-top:22px;font:400 12px/1.7 'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#9b9bab;\" align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dm4jfxbcs/image/upload/v1794414786/ufolabz-logo_for_header_mobile_ns7zn1.jpg\" alt=\"UFO LABZ\" width=\"90\" style=\"border:0;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;\"><br>\nAlien Performance Technology. Premium supplements engineered in Swiss laboratories.<br>\n<a href=\"{{instagram_url}}\" style=\"color:#ececf2;text-decoration:none;\">Instagram</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"{{facebook_url}}\" style=\"color:#ececf2;text-decoration:none;\">Facebook</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"{{youtube_url}}\" style=\"color:#ececf2;text-decoration:none;\">YouTube</a><br>\nQuestions? <a href=\"mailto:{{support_email}}\" style=\"color:#1fff6b;\">{{support_email}}</a><br>\u00a9 UFO LABZ \u00b7 ufolabz.com</td></tr></table></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table>"
